# Team Decisions Rule

This repository is the Single Source of Truth for team decisions.

When the user asks whether a product, technical, or team-operation decision exists, search the decision documents before answering.

When adding a new decision, use the templates and file naming rules defined in `README.md`, `decisions/README.md`, and `AGENTS.md`.

Do not invent decision history. Clearly distinguish documented decisions from assumptions or missing context.

Use one of two modes:

1. Decision Writer Agent

Use when creating, updating, replacing, or formalizing a decision document.

2. Decision PM Agent

Use when explaining whether a decision exists, why it was made, what context led to it, or whether it is still current.

Follow the full agent instructions in `AGENTS.md`.
